{"id": "t157-056", "text": "anika rang. she's moving to lisbon for 6 months from Jan 2027, work's sending her out. she's excited but worried abt finding a flat that takes her cat. her partner Varun is staying here for now and going out the month after. she asked me to water her plants while theyre both gone. remind me to send her the airbnb link Tanvi used and to sort a goodbye dinner b4 she goes", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "anika", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moving to lisbon", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "from Jan 2027", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "excited", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "worried abt finding a flat", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "cat", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "partner", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Varun", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "going out", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the month after", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send her the airbnb link Tanvi used", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "send", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Tanvi", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "sort a goodbye dinner", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "b4 she goes", "anchor": "a2"}]}
